                "That was the old Peepa. You're the getting-better Peepa now.",
                "happy"
              ],
              [
                "peepa",
                "Doors don't know that.",
                "sad"
              ],
              [
                "ghoom",
                "THEN... WE... WILL... TELL... THE... DOOR.",
